# Purpose
Explains global node discovery, node selection, and visible gvturn history across readable nodes.
# Dependencies
- `manage-turns-with-gv-menu-eventlog-gvturns.md`
# Gotchas
- Use `node_list` with `scope: global`; never infer global inventory from local mesh state.
